Step 4: Program DMA read channel 1 and write 0x1 to DMA_READ_DOORBELL_OFF.
Step 5: Wait for interrupt.
Step 6: Program DMA read channel 2 and write 0x2 to DMA_READ_DOORBELL_OFF.
Step 7: Wait for interrupt.
Step 8: Program DMA read channel 3 and write 0x3 to DMA_READ_DOORBELL_OFF.
Step 9: Wait for interrupt.","Each DMA read channel transfer completes successfully.
Interrupt is generated for each channel completion.
DMA read doorbell register accepts channel numbers 0-3.",DMA_READ_DOORBELL_OFF,0x30,PF0_DMA_CAP,0x380000,0x380030,"RD_DOORBELL_NUM, RD_STOP","[2:0], [31]","3, 1","other, other","0x0, 0x0",Write,"0x0 (Ch0), 0x1 (Ch1), 0x2 (Ch2), 0x3 (Ch3)",PCIE,TestRepo/PCIE/pcie_dma_write_test/program.c,"mizar_PCIE0_DBI_DSP_DMA_READ_DOORBELL_OFF, mizar_PCIE1_DBI_DSP_DMA_READ_DOORBELL_OFF",Sequential DMA read transfers on channels 0-3 with interrupt-driven completion
