11,pcie_dma_write_test,PCIe DMA Write Test - DMA Write Interrupt Clear,Clear DMA write interrupt after servicing,Functional,"Step 1: Write channel done status bits to DMA_WRITE_INT_CLEAR_OFF to clear the write done interrupt.","Write done interrupt is cleared successfully.",DMA_WRITE_INT_CLEAR_OFF,0x58,PF0_DMA_CAP,0x380000,0x380058,"WR_DONE_INT_CLEAR, WR_ABORT_INT_CLEAR","[3:0], [19:16]","4, 4","other, other","0x0, 0x0",Write,Channel-specific done status bits,PCIE,TestRepo/PCIE/pcie_dma_write_test/program.c,"mizar_PCIE0_DBI_DSP_DMA_WRITE_INT_CLEAR_OFF, mizar_PCIE1_DBI_DSP_DMA_WRITE_INT_CLEAR_OFF",Write-to-clear mechanism for DMA write interrupts
