13,pcie_dma_write_test,PCIe DMA Write Test - DMA Read Interrupt Clear,Clear DMA read interrupt after servicing,Functional,"Step 1: Write channel done status bits to DMA_READ_INT_CLEAR_OFF to clear the read done interrupt.","Read done interrupt is cleared successfully.",DMA_READ_INT_CLEAR_OFF,0xAC,PF0_DMA_CAP,0x380000,0x3800AC,"RD_DONE_INT_CLEAR, RD_ABORT_INT_CLEAR","[7:0], [23:16]","8, 8","other, other","0x0, 0x0",Write,Channel-specific done status bits,PCIE,TestRepo/PCIE/pcie_dma_write_test/program.c,"mizar_PCIE0_DBI_DSP_DMA_READ_INT_CLEAR_OFF, mizar_PCIE1_DBI_DSP_DMA_READ_INT_CLEAR_OFF",Write-to-clear mechanism for DMA read interrupts
14,pcie_mem_wr_rd_test,PCIe Memory Write Read Test - Cache Coherency Enable Programming,Program COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF to enable cache coherency for memory transactions,Functional,"Step 1: Read-modify-write PCIE0 COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF: set bits [14:11] (CFG_MSTR_AWCACHE_MODE) to 0xF and bits [6:3] (CFG_MSTR_ARCACHE_MODE) to 0xF.
Step 2: Read-modify-write PCIE0 COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF: set bits [30:27] (CFG_MSTR_AWCACHE_VALUE) to 0xF and bits [22:19] (CFG_MSTR_ARCACHE_VALUE) to 0xF.
Step 3: Repeat Steps 1-2 for PCIE1 COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF.
Step 4: Wait 20 cycles.
Step 5: Re-program PCIE0 COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF with all four cache fields set to 0xF in single write.
Step 6: Re-program PCIE1 COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF with all four cache fields set to 0xF in single write.","COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF for PCIE0 and PCIE1 programmed with cache mode and value fields set to 0xF.
Cache coherency enabled for both AXI master read and write channels.",COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF,0x1E8,PF0_PORT_LOGIC,0x700,0x8E8,"CFG_MSTR_ARCACHE_MODE, CFG_MSTR_AWCACHE_MODE, CFG_MSTR_ARCACHE_VALUE, CFG_MSTR_AWCACHE_VALUE","[6:3], [14:11], [22:19], [30:27]","4, 4, 4, 4","rw, rw, rw, rw","0x0, 0x0, 0x0, 0x0",Read-Modify-Write,0xF for all cache mode and value fields,PCIE,TestRepo/PCIE/pcie_mem_wr_rd_test/program.c,"mizar_PCIE0_DBI_DSP_COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF, mizar_PCIE1_DBI_DSP_COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF",Enable cache coherency before memory write/read transactions
15,pcie_mem_wr_rd_test,PCIe Memory Write Read Test - Cache Coherency Disable Programming,Disable cache coherency after memory transactions complete,Functional,"Step 1: Read-modify-write PCIE0 COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF: keep bits [14:11] and [6:3] at 0xF but set bits [22:19] (CFG_MSTR_ARCACHE_VALUE) to 0x0.
Step 2: Repeat for PCIE1.
Step 3: Wait 10 cycles.
Step 4: Set both CFG_MSTR_ARCACHE_VALUE [22:19] and CFG_MSTR_AWCACHE_VALUE [30:27] to 0x0 for PCIE0.
Step 5: Repeat for PCIE1.","Cache value fields cleared to 0x0 while mode fields remain at 0xF.
Cache coherency effectively disabled for memory transactions.",COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF,0x1E8,PF0_PORT_LOGIC,0x700,0x8E8,"CFG_MSTR_ARCACHE_MODE, CFG_MSTR_AWCACHE_MODE, CFG_MSTR_ARCACHE_VALUE, CFG_MSTR_AWCACHE_VALUE","[6:3], [14:11], [22:19], [30:27]","4, 4, 4, 4","rw, rw, rw, rw","0x0, 0x0, 0x0, 0x0",Read-Modify-Write,"0xF (mode), 0x0 (value - disable)",PCIE,TestRepo/PCIE/pcie_mem_wr_rd_test/program.c,"mizar_PCIE0_DBI_DSP_COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF, mizar_PCIE1_DBI_DSP_COHERENCY_CONTROL_3_OFF",Disable cache coherency after memory write/read test completes
16,pcie_mem_wr_rd_test,PCIe Memory Write Read Test - Memory Write and Read via PCIe Slave,Perform memory write followed by read via PCIe slave interface to verify data integrity,Functional,"Step 1: For DM0_RC: Call pcie_slv0_mem_wr_rd with address 0x01040000 and data 0xa5a5a5a5.
Step 2: Call pcie_slv0_mem_wr_rd with address 0x01000020 and data 0xa6a6a6a6.
Step 3: Call pcie_slv0_mem_wr_rd with address 0x01004000 and data 0xa7a7a7a7.
Step 4: For DM1_RC: Call pcie_slv1_mem_wr_rd with address 0x01040000 and data 0xb5b5b5b5.
Step 5: Call pcie_slv1_mem_wr_rd with address 0x01000020 and data 0xb5b5b6b6.
Step 6: Call pcie_slv1_mem_wr_rd with address 0x01004000 and data 0xb7b7b5b5.
Step 7: For DM0_EP: Call pcie_slv0_mem_wr_rd for BAR1 regions at offsets 0x10100 0x20100 0x1B100 0x2B100 0x30100 with data 0x5a5a5a5a.
Step 8: For DM1_EP: Call pcie_slv1_mem_wr_rd for BAR1 regions with same offsets and data.","Memory write followed by read returns matching data for all addresses.
No data corruption across PCIe link for RC and EP modes.
BAR1 memory regions accessible in EP mode.",N/A (Memory Space),N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,N/A,Write then Read,"0xa5a5a5a5, 0xa6a6a6a6, 0xa7a7a7a7, 0xb5b5b5b5, 0x5a5a5a5a",PCIE,TestRepo/PCIE/pcie_mem_wr_rd_test/program.c,pcie_slv0_mem_wr_rd / pcie_slv1_mem_wr_rd,Memory write-read verification through PCIe slave interface for RC and EP modes
