22,pcie_reg_wr_rd_test,PCIe Register Write Read Test - SII Register Reset Value Check,Verify reset default values of SII registers (TRANSMIT_HEADER2/3 and PHY_CONTROL_23),Functional,"Step 1: Read PCIE0_SII_PCIE0_TRANSMIT_HEADER2 and verify reset value is 0x0.
