26,pcie_reg_wr_rd_test,PCIe Register Write Read Test - SII Register Read-Write Check,Write test patterns to SII registers with write masks and verify readback,Functional,"Step 1: Write (chk_val & write_mask) to PCIE0 SII registers (TRANSMIT_HEADER2 mask=0xFFFFFFFF TRANSMIT_HEADER3 mask=0xFFFFFFFF PHY_CONTROL_23 mask=0xF000F).
